      "mnemonic": {
        "method": "后退一步",
        "content": "把真实条件句“往过去退一步”就变成假设：If it rains, I will stay.（真实）→ If it rained, I would stay.（假设）。看到 if + 过去式，主句就用 would。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "asset_eng_grammar_modal_would_hypothetical_b1_production",
      "knowledgePointId": "eng_grammar_modal_would_hypothetical_b1",
